{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zX7oDdPb2q1794915076.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>泰國一處海灘發現疑似來自太空的殘骸。</p><p></p><p>泰國南部旅遊勝地，PP島附近的竹子島，近期在海灘上發現一個大型的不明金屬球體。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.OBJECT-1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ixKh8eDa4e1794915089.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>泰國地理資訊及太空技術發展局，緊急派員前往接收，初步懷疑是來自太空的殘骸，可能來自火箭或者衛星，已將它送往春武里府的太空創新園區，進行詳細分析。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.OBJECT-1700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268OxwPOzcBW1794915101.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據報金屬球體最初被發現漂浮在竹子島附近海域，隨後沖上岸。局方專家與海事指揮中心，以及國家公園官員會面，商討追查物體來源以及海上安全措施等問題。</p><p></p><p>當局呼籲，民眾應避免接觸或移動任何疑似太空殘骸的物體，如果發現類似物件，應先拍照記錄位置，並通知有關當局。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.778341+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:54:45.031884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:49.661486+00:00","content_hash":"94b03a952923aaab6de04cbb1c9ee664f2d9ca10010d0964eb1fffeed0fee5ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}